  "subject": "A woman at a Tonggang ice factory slips a sealed one-line note into each tank before the 24-hour freeze so it sits inside the block loaded on her husband's boat, and when he comes home he returns the whole bundle of salt-stained notes with a pencil reply on the last one.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese Hokkien German-style Lied art-song, through-composed feel with a repeating piano figure. Grand piano playing gentle broken-chord accompaniment with clear pedalled bass; solo cello holding a low singing line and answering the voice between phrases. Intimate chamber recording, close piano, natural room, dry vocal. Female mezzo-soprano, restrained and plain with gentle vibrato, clearly sung melody, one lead voice. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 66 BPM, E-flat major. Restrained, devoted, quietly warm mood. No rap, no drums, no trap hi-hats, no autotune, no synth pads, no operatic belting.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n冰廠的水 注入鐵桶仔\n二十四點鐘 凍成一塊\n透早 我共批囥入去\n紙仔包兩重 袋仔縛予緊\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n這塊欲載去 阿國的船\n伊的手 自然會鑿著\n\n[Chorus]\n冰角內底 有我一句話\n你鑿第三日 就會看見\n我無寫甘言 干焦寫著\n今仔日 厝內攏好勢\n\n[Verse]\n人講冰是為著鮮魚\n我知 冰嘛是為著你\n船出港 三工的日頭\n一塊冰 慢慢仔縮\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n批紙寫啥物 我袂講\n冰會替我 慢慢仔講\n\n[Chorus]\n冰角內底 有我一句話\n你鑿第三日 就會看見\n昨昏寫 菜脯卵煎好矣\n今仔日寫 燈我有留\n\n[Verse]\n阿國轉來 無講啥物\n倒一桶 船頂的衫仔褲\n底層 一疊乾的批紙\n一張一張 攏有鹽花\n\n[Bridge]\n上尾彼張 伊用鉛筆\n寫 我有看 我嘛攏好\n\n[Chorus]\n冰角內底 有咱兩人的話\n鑿開的時 水就慢慢仔流\n我無寫甘言 伊嘛無\n今仔日 咱攏好勢\n\n[Outro]\n二十四點鐘 閣一塊\n我閣提筆 寫一句",
